The files in bin\ are the Release build of Muscle Wrapping 2.x and of the libraries it
links to, unmodified, except that the LLVM OpenMP runtime of conda-forge (libomp.dll) is
installed as libomp140.x86_64.dll, the name under which the binaries import it.
Their licences: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md and licenses\.

The example in example\ is derived from the Living Human Digital Library (LHDL) dataset
and is licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 2.0 BE, not under Apache-2.0 (see example\LICENSE).

Packaged for msk-pipe (https://github.com/kivzcu/msk-pipe) by Patrik Mrnka and
Josef Kohout, University of West Bohemia in Pilsen. demo.json lists the versions and
the SHA-256 of every file.
